### PhotoBase API — Smoke tests with authentication
### For VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client
### Base URL (adjust port to match your launchSettings.json)
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001

### 
### AUTH — Login to get JWT tokens
### 

### 1a. Login as Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@photobase.dev",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with { token, email, role: "Admin", expiresUtc }

### 1b. Login as Internal user
# @name internalLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@photobase.dev",
  "password": "User123!"
}

### Expected: 200 OK with { token, email, role: "Internal", expiresUtc }

### 1c. Login with wrong password (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@photobase.dev",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### Save the admin token from 1a for subsequent requests:
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
@internalToken = {{internalLogin.response.body.token}}

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### PUBLIC ENDPOINTS — No token required
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????

### 2. Search assets (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets?page=1&pageSize=10

### Expected: 200 OK with PagedResult

### 3. Search with query (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets?query=Magnolia&page=1&pageSize=10

### Expected: 200 OK, filtered results

### 4. Get asset detail (replace with real GUID after uploading)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Expected: 404 for fake ID; 200 with AssetDetailDto for real ID

### 5. Get thumbnail (replace with real GUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/thumb

### Expected: image/jpeg response

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### ADMIN-ONLY — Import plant records
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????

### 6a. Import TSV — with Admin token (should succeed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/import/plant-records
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="plant-records.tsv"
Content-Type: text/tab-separated-values

AccessionNumber	PlantName	Location	CollectionTrip
2024-0001	Magnolia zenii	Garden A - Section 3	Spring 2024 East Asia
2024-0002	Quercus alba	Garden B - Oak Collection	Fall 2023 Appalachian
2024-0003	Acer palmatum	Garden C - Japanese Maples	
------FormBoundary--

### Expected: 200 OK with { imported: 3, updated: 0, errors: 0 }

### 6b. Import TSV — without token (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/import/plant-records
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="plant-records.tsv"
Content-Type: text/tab-separated-values

AccessionNumber	PlantName	Location
2024-0099	Test Plant	Test Location
------FormBoundary--

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### 6c. Import TSV — with Internal token (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/import/plant-records
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="plant-records.tsv"
Content-Type: text/tab-separated-values

AccessionNumber	PlantName	Location
2024-0099	Test Plant	Test Location
------FormBoundary--

### Expected: 403 Forbidden

### ??????????????????????????????????????????????
### ADMIN-ONLY — Upload image
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????

### 7a. Upload — with Admin token
# Use curl for actual file uploads:
# curl -X POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assets \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>" \
#   -F "file=@./test-image.jpg" \
#   -F "Title=Test Magnolia" \
#   -F "AccessionNumber=2024-0001" \
#   -F "Keywords=magnolia,test"
#
# Expected: 201 Created with AssetDetailDto

### 7b. Upload — without token (should fail)
# curl -X POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assets \
#   -F "file=@./test-image.jpg" \
#   -F "Title=Test No Auth"
#
# Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### 7c. Upload — with Internal token (should fail)
# curl -X POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assets \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer <INTERNAL_TOKEN>" \
#   -F "file=@./test-image.jpg" \
#   -F "Title=Test Internal"
#
# Expected: 403 Forbidden

