### AUTH REQUIRED — Download original
### ??????????????????????????????????????????????

### 8a. Download — with Internal token (replace GUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/download
Authorization: Bearer {{internalToken}}

### Expected: 200 with Content-Disposition: attachment

### 8b. Download — with Admin token (replace GUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/download
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Expected: 200 with Content-Disposition: attachment

### 8c. Download — without token (should fail, replace GUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/download

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
